  "name": "Low FODMAP Slow Cooker (Instant Pot) Vegan Butternut Squash Soup Recip | Casa De Sante",
  "ingredients": "1 butternut squash peeled and diced (up to 2 cups)\n4 peeled and diced carrots\n3 tbsp FODMAP Vegan Stock Powder\n3 cups hot water\n1 can coconut milk\nsalt and pepper to taste\n1 tsp Casa mixed herbs",
  "directions": "Combine squash, spices, stock, water, and carrots in a slow cooker.\n\nCover and cook on low for 6 hours.\n\nTransfer contents to a blender and puree until smooth.\n\nStir in coconut milk, salt, and pepper.\n\nServe and enjoy!",
